gaGk(){return"I have read this and I accept how DesKilo handles my data."},
gaGl(){return"Each space is run by its owner \u2014 your community \u2014 who decides members, prices and payment providers. Each server is run by its operator: the shared reference server by Florian Dittgen (Germany), a community's own server by whoever runs it. The app is free software (AGPL-3.0-or-later), published by Florian Dittgen. Online payments go through the provider the owner enabled (PayPal, Stripe, Mollie, Wero) under that provider's terms."},
gaGm(){return"Who is responsible"},
gaGn(){return"Before you use DesKilo, here is what the app does with your data, who can see it and what you can do about it. Two minutes; it is all there is."},
gaGo(){return"Only the people in a conversation can open it: the two of you, the members of a group or, when you write to a space, the hosts the app names before you send. A space's owners and admins cannot read your conversations. Messages are not end-to-end encrypted: they are stored on the server the conversation lives on \u2014 another server's, after you confirm, when you write to someone there \u2014 and whoever runs that server can technically reach them."},
gaGp(){return"Messages"},
gaGq(){return"No tracking, no analytics, no advertising, no sale of data. Your data goes to nobody except the recipients named here and in the server's notice. The F-Droid build has no Google services at all."},
gaGr(){return"What DesKilo never does"},
gaGs(){return"Optional, and outbound. When the server's operator has set push up, your space uses it and it is on for this device, this device's address and each notification go to the push service (Firebase Cloud Messaging, which hands notifications for Apple devices on to Apple). A notification only says something generic, such as \"You have a new message\": no names, no times, no message text. Switch it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & data; the app keeps working and nothing more is sent to this device."},
gaGt(){return"Push notifications"},
gaGu(){return"Read in the help"},
gaGv(){return"Read in the online guide"},
gaGw(){return"As long as you are a member. When you leave a space and erase, your messages in that space go, and your profile goes with your last space. Accounting records stay for the legal retention period: the ledger by identifier, invoices as they were issued."},
gaGx(){return"How long"},
