gad9(){return"How many days ahead the member directory shows the next booking of a member."},
gada(){return"Days after issue before a first reminder is suggested, and before an invoice falls due when no payment term was set."},
gadb(){return"Seconds a server waits for the answer to a signed message it sent to another server before it sends the same message again. At least 30; keep it below the status lifetime."},
gadc(){return"Hours a server keeps the receipts of signed messages between servers, and a personal home the tombstones of ended memberships, before the hourly cleanup removes them. Never shorter than the longest status lifetime plus twice the clock difference."},
gade(){return"Seconds of clock difference between the personal home and a workspace server that are still accepted, 0 to 30."},
gadf(){return"Seconds a workspace server may rely on one identity status signed by the personal home. At most 900: a suspended account is refused new requests within this time plus the clock skew."},
gadg(){return"Seconds between two refreshes of the identity statuses a workspace server holds. Keep it below the status lifetime."},
gadh(){return"Fixed by the platform: the longest period one capacity figure may cover. It bounds the query."},
gadi(){return"Fixed by the platform: the months beyond the first that one finance figure may span (23 means 24 months in all). It bounds the query."},
gadj(){return"Where a new workspace starts when the device's region is unknown. A suggestion only; it decides no tax or issuer country."},
gadk(){return"What amounts are shown in before a workspace is connected, and where a new workspace starts. It never stands in for a missing invoice currency."},
gadl(){return"The format used before a member or workspace has chosen one. A member's own choice always wins."},
gadm(){return"Minutes the person has to confirm an action an assistant asked for. Requests already made keep their time. Can only be shortened."},
gadn(){return"Days a read operator notice is kept before it is purged. Unread notices, grants, consents and the audit trail are never purged by this value."},
gado(){return"Minutes a successful check of the assistant endpoint counts before the interface is turned on. Can only be shortened."},
gadp(){return"Fixed by the platform: the longest window one assistant read may ask for. It bounds the query; it is not a permission to scan more."},
gadq(){return"Minutes after sending in which the author may still correct a message. A workspace message reads its workspace, a personal or group message the platform value."},
gadr(){return"How many groups one person may create per hour. Can only be lowered."},
gads(){return"How many conversations the personal home and each workspace server return per page of the inbox; older ones come with Show older conversations."},
gadt(){return"Seconds between two refreshes of the inbox and its unread badge. Lower values load the server more."},
