gadE(){return"Minutes after its last sign of life that a person still counts as online. Keep it above the 2-minute heartbeat."},
gadF(){return"Minutes the app must have been out of sight (in the background, a hidden tab, a sleeping kiosk) before it re-reads everything it shows when it comes back. Switching windows never re-reads; a lost live connection always does."},
